{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for SaveEase', 'description': 'Primary container for SaveEase implementation: A cross-platform mobile app for micro-savings, designed for low-income users. The app enables simple onboarding, regular micro-savings (scheduled or round-up), goal tracking, withdrawals (with emergency reason), and gamification (streaks, badges). It prioritizes security, lightweight performance, and a user-friendly, accessible UI. The MVP focuses on a seamless flow from registration to withdrawal, with mock integrations and offline support.', 'framework': 'flutter', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "User Onboarding",\n      "description": "Simple registration via phone/email, optional KYC with secure document upload.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Savings Mechanism",\n      "description": "Round-up and scheduled micro-savings, track total saved, and support for goal-based saving.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Withdrawals",\n      "description": "Users can withdraw savings anytime, with an \'Emergency Reason\' field.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Savings Goals",\n      "description": "Set and track multiple savings goals with progress bars and optional deadlines/reminders.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Gamification",\n      "description": "Streaks for consistent saving and visual badges for milestones.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Security",\n      "description": "PIN or biometric login, all user data encrypted in transit and at rest.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Simple UI/UX",\n      "description": "Mobile-first, accessible fonts, large buttons, minimal screens, colorful and encouraging visuals.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Offline Support & Localization",\n      "description": "Works with intermittent internet and supports multiple languages (RTL optional).",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "Flutter"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#2E7D32",\n    "secondary": "#F9A825",\n    "accent": "#00B8D4"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app opens with a simple onboarding flow (registration, optional KYC). The home dashboard shows total savings, active goals (with progress bars), and quick actions (save, withdraw). A bottom navigation bar provides access to Home, Goals, Withdraw, and Settings. Each goal has a detail screen with progress, reminders, and history. The withdrawal screen collects amount and emergency reason. Settings allow PIN/biometric setup, language selection, and account management. UI uses large buttons, accessible fonts, and colorful visuals for encouragement."\n}'}",
